{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 38, :comments ["<b>Here I have come to you.</b> Even though I came to you then as you requested, what would I have availed you? And so too now." "<b>Am I able to speak anything at all?</b> That is, am I able to speak in the manner of every speaker who acts by his own will?" "<b>The word that Elohim puts in my mouth, that I shall speak.</b> As in רוּחַ ה׳ דִּבֶּר בִּי (II Samuel 23:2) — and in this manner I myself will not be the one speaking."], :book :numbers, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:40:48.501931328Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}